# Contact form → Telegram Bot
# 1. @BotFather → /newbot → paste token below
# 2. Open YOUR bot in Telegram and press Start (send any message)
# 3. Open in browser:
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates
# 4. Find result[0].message.chat.id (a number, can be negative for groups)
# 5. Paste that number into TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (no quotes, no @username)
# 6. Restart npm run dev

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
